*   &net4 @WIRE(mode="straight") {%j6 (11, -3) #XMP2:3};
*   &net4 @WIRE(mode="straight") {#XMP3:1 %j6};
*   &net2 @WIRE(mode="straight") {#XMP1:1 %j7};
